  storyTitle: Shadows of the Forgotten
  genre: Mystery
  synopsis: 'In the eerie and abandoned CEIT Building of Pamantasan ng Lungsod ng
    Valenzuela (PLV), a legend surrounds a reclusive art professor who went mad and
    vanished decades ago. As a curious student, you are drawn to explore the forgotten
    halls, only to uncover that the professor''s spirit may still be lingering, driven
    to complete one last, twisted masterpiece. '
